            <rule id="3439-2820-4b1b-ffbc" name="Basileus (Emperor; Ld 10; armies over 2,000 pts; +25 pts)" hidden="false">
              <description>Emperor as Army General: should the total army value exceed 2,000 pts, the Domestikos may be upgraded to Basileus (Emperor, Leadership 10, +25 pts).</description>
