              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow and buckler. May have light armour (+3 pts). Tagmata and Elite Themata Kavallarioi Toxotai may have heavy armour (+4 pts). Superior Byzantine Cavalry. Combined Formation - Hippo-toxotai must combine with Kavallarioi, they cannot be taken on their own (not enforced). May be Drilled (+1 pt).  (Byzantium p.69)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="1b5e-49b0-3e49-aa7d" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
