              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, buckler &amp; bow. Special Rules: Combined Formation - Toxotai must combine with Kontaratoi, they cannot be taken on their own (not enforced). Elite Themata Toxotai may be Drilled (+1 pt). Irregular troops count as Levies.  (Byzantium p.69)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="798c-848e-3c4a-9555" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">None</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">6+ with Buckler +1 in hand-to-hand only</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <!-- armour-save -->
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
